  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>System of linear equations,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Now finding,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now finding,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;options we get,</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;we&#39;ll have infinite solution</p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>unique solution</p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;unique solution</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;we&#39;ll have no solution</p></blockquote>"
  }
